  "releaseNotes": "The jsdiff and diff2html assets now ship inside the package and load on demand, so a consuming app no longer has to add CDN script and stylesheet tags to index.html. Missing tags previously caused a JS interop error at runtime. Apps that still have those tags keep working; the loader skips a library whose global is already present.\nSee THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt for the bundled components and their licences.",
